                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e1b1ddc-43f8-4d2f-b635-a7069ee1711c",
                                                "sense_id": "933e97cf-c3fd-322a-96fa-ad852141852c",
                                                "text": "an aimless life"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03c142ee-12da-4e7a-a960-d4d811329da9",
                                                "sense_id": "933e97cf-c3fd-322a-96fa-ad852141852c",
                                                "text": "In the first few days of the fourth stage the lobsterlings are good swimmers — this is their \"redeeming vice\" — but the swimming is strong and bears no comparison to the aimless drifting movement characteristic of larval stages."
                                            }
